### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

@defaultPassword = YOUR_PASSWORD_HERE

### 2. Login Operator
# @name loginOperator
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "OP001",
  "password": "{{defaultPassword}}",
  "device": {
    "device_id": "review-pc-operator",
    "model": "Desktop Client"
  }
}

### Simpan token operator dari respons di atas
@operatorToken = {{loginOperator.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Login Guru
# @name loginGuru
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "GURU001",
  "password": "{{defaultPassword}}",
  "device": {
    "device_id": "review-pc-guru",
    "model": "Desktop Client"
  }
}

### Simpan token guru dari respons di atas
@guruToken = {{loginGuru.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Login Siswa
# @name loginSiswa
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "SISWA001",
  "password": "{{defaultPassword}}",
  "device": {
    "device_id": "review-pc-siswa",
    "model": "Desktop Client"
  }
}

### Simpan token siswa dari respons di atas
@siswaToken = {{loginSiswa.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Operator: Lihat Daftar Pengguna
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 6. Operator: Lihat Daftar Titik Lokasi Sekolah
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 7. Operator: Lihat Daftar Jadwal
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 8. Guru: Lihat Jadwal Mengajar Pribadi
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/me/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{guruToken}}

### 9. Guru: Lihat Sesi Absensi
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{guruToken}}

### 10. Siswa: Lihat Jadwal Belajar Pribadi
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/me/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{siswaToken}}
